  "summary": "Extensive years of software development and technical leadership experience in a variety of industries including: telecommunications, retail, food service and trading. Specific applications delivered include: customer interaction automation, web-based online ordering, cellular switching systems, air-to-ground telephone system, digital switching, financial trading systems, real-time data collection, paging systems, 2-way radio systems, computer telephony integration, customer service and warehouse management. Technical skills have been focused on projects using distributed client/server architectures and distributed processing architectures requiring knowledge of various technical platforms. Recent projects have evolved more heavily towards using Windows solutions versus using Unix solutions and have required utilization of relational database management systems (RDBMS).\n\nSpecialties: Hard real-time and pseudo real-time software development.",
